            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-39620\"><b>Laurey 39620, Paris Cabinet Knob in Matte Black</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Paris  Matte Black Knob is a stunning example of traditional hardware done right. It adds interest, old world beauty and manages to affordable enough you can redo all your cabinets. The Paris Cabinet Knob in  Matte Black comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Paris\">Laurey Paris Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 39620 1-1/4\" Knob Paris Matte Black:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available finishes:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" >\r\n<tr align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39620\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39620-SM.jpg?v=1704354656\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39620\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/paris-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-39666\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39666-SM.jpg?v=1704354656\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39666\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39620\"><b>Matte Black</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/paris-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-39666\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
